---
import MarketingLayout from "../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro";
---

<MarketingLayout
  title="Download"
  description="Download Cocurdex for macOS. Windows and Linux builds follow. Pre-release."
  path="/download/"
>
  <main class="prose-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Pre-release</p>
    <h1>Download Cocurdex</h1>
    <p>
      Public installers are not linked here yet. Builds ship from the desktop
      release pipeline; this page will list signed downloads per platform when
      they are ready.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>macOS</strong> — primary target (Apple silicon first)</li>
      <li><strong>Windows</strong> — next</li>
      <li><strong>Linux</strong> — after Windows</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="note">
      Until public artifacts are published, use a local or CI-built desktop
      package from the monorepo (<code>apps/desktop</code>). See
      <a href="/docs/getting-started/">Getting started</a> for the intended
      install flow.
    </div>
    <div class="actions" style="margin-top: 1.75rem">
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="/docs/">Read the docs</a>
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="/">Back to home</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</MarketingLayout>
